COMPONENT ProtectedPayloadCodec

PROTECT(scope, plaintext)
    validate the scope and input
    protected_payload = PRIVATE_SECURITY_IMPLEMENTATION.protect(scope, plaintext)
    return protected_payload

RECOVER(scope, protected_payload)
    validate the scope and payload
    plaintext = PRIVATE_SECURITY_IMPLEMENTATION.recover(scope, protected_payload)
    reject invalid or modified payloads
    return plaintext

NOTE
    The protection format and implementation are intentionally omitted.
